From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:54:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223A: lamp catalog - classic lamps, torches,
 braziers, candles and fires without M2 lights light the world

- Zeppelin\LampCatalog.txt (PATCH-V, generated by zep-vulkan-shaders/lamp-catalog from the stock client): path,
  light position in model space, colour * intensity on CM2Light's scale, flicker flag
- GatherFrame adds a light per catalog model in the scene (world transform, sqrt scale, flames flicker), so both
  hdLightPass (Vulkan) and hdLights (D3D9) get them; hdLampCatalog 1/0; hdLightsInfo counts them

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UHcJJVC4feQ4s15e9bNRoN
